message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: OpenInjectability
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-02"
license: MIT
url: "https://pypi.org/project/openinjectability/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/priyamthakar/OpenInjectability"
abstract: >
  Transparent Newtonian fluid-resistance assessment for syringe and needle
  scenarios. Computes predicted fluid-resistance force from idealized laminar
  capillary flow; not a total device force model. Alpha release; independent
  experimental validation pending.
authors:
  - name: OpenInjectability contributors
keywords:
  - injectability
  - syringeability
  - newtonian
  - hagen-poiseuille
